{
  "summary": "中国具身智能机器人企业可分为三大技术路线：专注派（如汇川技术、中科新松、天机、遨博智能、华沿机器人、非夕科技）专注原有工业机器人业务并延伸至具身智能；控制派（如拓斯达、新时达、新松机器人）从运动控制切入，结合AI大模型；全栈派（如埃斯顿酷卓、库卡、埃夫特、越疆机器人、珞石机器人、节卡机器人）全面布局本体、控制与大脑。宇树科技、智元机器人、银河通用、星动纪元等未在本文中提及。",
  "key_excerpts": [
    "专注派专注原有工业机器人业务和产品，并将其优势延伸到具身智能领域，典型代表企业有汇川技术、中科新松、天机、遨博智能、华沿机器人（原大族机器人）、非夕科技等。",
    "控制派从机器人的运动控制角度切入，将AI大模型能力与机器人控制系统结合，将大脑的决策指令传递给机器人本体进行实时操作反馈，承担具身智能“小脑”的角色，主要代表企业为拓斯达、新时达、新松机器人等。",
    "全栈派摆脱了从单一角度切入，包揽了对具身智能机器人本体、运动控制系统、多模态具身大脑的研究，如埃斯顿酷卓、库卡、埃夫特、越疆机器人、珞石机器人、节卡机器人、天链机器人、睿尔曼智能等机器人本体企业已经主动进军，坚持全栈式布局的技术路线。"
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "具身智能主流技术路线包括端到端VLA大模型、分层架构、模仿学习+强化学习等。VLA模型统一视觉、语言和动作，实现端到端感知-推理-控制；分层架构将高层规划与底层控制分离；模仿学习从专家演示中学习策略，强化学习通过试错优化行为。VLA模型通过动作令牌化扩展视觉-语言模型，具备强泛化能力，而分层架构和模仿学习+强化学习则更注重模块化与样本效率。",
  "key_excerpts": [
    "Vision-Language-Action (VLA) models mark a transformative advancement in artificial intelligence, aiming to unify perception, natural language understanding, and embodied action within a single computational framework.",
    "VLA models, conceptualized around 2021-2022, and pioneered by efforts such as Google DeepMind's Robotic Transformer 2 (RT-2), introduced a transformative architecture that unified perception, reasoning, and control within a single framework.",
    "Early VLA approaches achieved this integration by extending vision-language models to include action tokens numerical or symbolic representations of robot motor commands, thereby allowing the model to learn from paired vision, language, and trajectory data.",
    "This methodological innovation dramatically improved robots' ability to generalize to unseen objects, interpret novel language commands, and perform multi-step reasoning in unstructured environments.",
    "VLA models represent a transformative step in the development of unified multi-modal intelligence, overcoming the long-standing limitations of treating vision, language, and action as separate domains."
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "欧洲具身智能公司Humanoid成立于伦敦，开发了人形机器人HMND 01，近期完成1.52亿美元A轮融资，估值13.5亿美元。该公司已与舍弗勒签署1000台机器人订单，并获得博世支持，计划未来五年生产10万台。",
  "key_excerpts": [
    "Europe has a new billion-dollar startup, and it’s Humanoid, a two-year-old company headquartered in London that developed its humanoid robot, HMND 01, in near-record time.",
    "Today, London-based Humanoid announced that it has raised a $152 million Series A at a $1.35 billion post-money valuation.",
    "The funding comes just months after the company signed a 1,000-robot deal with Schaeffler and secured production capacity, backed by Bosch, that would enable the production of 100,000 units over the next five years."
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "具身智能主流技术路线包括模块化分层、分层大模型、端到端VLA大模型和世界模型四条路径。模块化分层路线用传统深度学习实现感知，机器人学习训练运动技能，通过人工编程组合。分层大模型路线以LLM/VLM作为大脑进行任务推理规划，通过API调用动作策略。端到端VLA路线将视觉、语言和动作统一到单一框架，直接输出动作控制本体。世界模型路线通过动力学建模和未来观察进行行为预演，指导动作策略学习。各路线在感知、规划、执行和泛化能力上存在差异，目前技术路径尚未收敛。",
  "key_excerpts": [
    "具身智能技术路径整体可分为四条，包括模块化分层、分层大模型、端到端大模型和世界模型",
    "模块化分层路线上，用传统深度学习算法实现感知，用机器人学习算法训练运动技能，并通过人工编程实现感知与运控的模块化组合或高难度组合式运控",
    "分层大模型路线上，用LLM、VLM作为“大脑”进行任务推理和规划，并通过API调用相应的动作策略",
    "端到端大模型路线上，端到端VLA将视觉、语言和动作统一到一个学习框架，根据视觉观测和自然语言指令输入端到端地输出动作，通过大小脑的协同作用直接控制本体执行任务",
    "世界模型路线上，通过动力学建模和未来观察进行行为预演和动作预测，以指导VLA动作策略学习或动作生成"
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "具身智能主流技术路线包括端到端VLA大模型、分层架构、模仿学习+强化学习等。端到端VLA大模型（如RT-2、OpenVLA）基于跨模态Transformer，实现视觉-语言-动作的统一表示和端到端控制。分层架构将系统分解为感知、建模、决策等层次，如DP-TA框架包含多模态感知对齐、世界模型与任务图生成、策略适应与执行调度三层。模仿学习与强化学习结合用于策略优化，其中世界模型可模拟未来状态并支持Sim-to-Real迁移。这些路线在系统通用性、跨任务学习和部署灵活性上各有侧重。",
  "key_excerpts": [
    "MLMs, including RT-2 (Zitkovich et al., 2023) and OpenVLA (Kim et al., 2024), are built on cross-modal Transformer architectures. This design enables them to create a unified representation from different input types, such as vision and language, and perform joint reasoning to achieve end-to-end control that directly translates natural language commands into physical actions.",
    "Concurrently, WMs (Ha and Schmidhuber, 2018b) aim to build an internal understanding of an environment by learning its latent states, enabling them to simulate potential future states and model causal relationships.",
    "this review proposes a structured modeling framework for embodied intelligent systems: the DP-TA (Dynamic Perception–Task Adaptation) three-layer fusion architecture. This framework decomposes embodied systems into three core functional layers: multimodal perception and alignment, world modeling and task graph generation, and policy adaptation and execution scheduling.",
    "The combination of MLMs and WMs brings notable benefits, including improved system generality, support for cross-task learning, and facilitated deployment from simulation to reality (Sim-to-Real)."
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "特斯拉的Optimus人形机器人旨在执行重复、枯燥或危险的任务，释放人类时间用于高价值工作。其设计包含六大核心系统：机械结构与定制执行器、高灵巧手部（27自由度）、双足运动规划、计算引擎与神经网络、传感器与视觉导航、运动控制系统。特斯拉自研了定制执行器以满足功率、精度和效率需求。目前Optimus已在特斯拉工厂部署，并计划大规模量产。",
  "key_excerpts": [
    "the team at Tesla first revealed the concept version around 2021. The core vision behind this project centered around the concept of a world built by humans for humans.",
    "Team at Tesla wants to address this challenge by building a general purpose humanoid that can perform these tasks and free up time for humans to focus on high-value tasks.",
    "it is composed of six core systems. This includes, but is not limited to, the mechanical structure and custom actuators, ultra-dexterous spatial manipulators with 27 degrees of freedom, bipedal locomotion & planning system, compute engine and the neural networks, sensors and visual navigation system, locomotion and planning system, and last but not the least motion control system.",
    "the team came to the conclusion that off the shelf actuators available in the stores won't be a good fit for the humanoids as they were not capable of meeting those requirements. So what did they do? In a classic Tesla-way they designed a portfolio of custom actuators in-house that could meet those requirements.",
    "Today, you can see many of the latest versions of Optimus in Tesla factories."
  ]
}
